---
<!-- STUB: to be built -->
<Base
  title="How to Help — Together with Grace"
  description="There are many ways you can help us achieve our mission. You can donate, volunteer, or spread the word about our organization."
>
  <div class="section stub-shell">
    <Piece as="div" shape="rect" label="STUB · HOW TO HELP" cut="CUT 1" class="stub-piece">
      <h1>How to Help</h1>
